    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In your Charge phase, use this once your IRONKIN STEELJACKS finish charging. You can spend 1 Yield Point. Pick an enemy in Engagement Range of the Steeljacks and roll a D6 per Steeljack model. If you spent the point, roll another D6 per model in the enemy unit, counting neither MONSTERS nor VEHICLES. Each 4+ deals 1 mortal wound to the enemy, up to 6 in total.",
